{
  "format": 1,
  "about": [
    "The contract between the platform and the Unity SDK's Editor Simulator, for the 13 routes the SDK calls.",
    "backend/tests/test_sdk_contract.py runs every case against the platform's real handlers; the SDK repository keeps a copy and runs every case against its local backend. A change to any of these routes updates this file in the same pull request.",
    "firestore: the documents the platform starts from. simulatorConfig: what GET /catalog/game/{gameId}/simulator-config exports for them, minus exportedAt; the backend test checks the two agree, and the SDK loads simulatorConfig.",
    "A case's steps share one state, so state is built through the routes themselves. 'given' seeds what no SDK route can create: the platform wallet balance and the inventory.",
    "Each step runs as the signed-in player unless 'as' is 'guest', who sends no token. 'expect.data' matches as a subset: every key listed must be present with that value, lists must match in length and order, and numbers compare by value.",
    "In a body, {\"$repeat\": text, \"count\": n} stands for the text repeated n times, and {\"$repeatItem\": value, \"count\": n} for a list of n copies."
  ],
  "player": { "uid": "player-1" },
  "firestore": {
    "games/game-1": {
      "developerUid": "dev-1",
      "gameKey": "gk_contract",
      "name": "Contract Game",
      "status": "active"
    },
    "games/game-1/achievements/collector": {
      "name": "Collector",
      "description": "Collect three",
      "type": "incremental",
      "targetValue": 3,
      "points": 50
    },
    "games/game-1/achievements/first_win": {
      "name": "First win",
      "description": "Win once",
      "type": "oneshot",
      "points": 100
    },
    "games/game-1/achievements/no_target": {
      "name": "No target",
      "type": "incremental",
      "points": 5
    },
    "games/game-1/economy_config/game-1": {
      "currencies": {},
      "items": {
